1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
beat beat beat beat

2
00:00:07,166 --> 00:00:09,466
Funky drum beat and whistle

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:14,600
Wiggle your body... and don't forget to freeze!

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,100
Shake your little shoulders, shake your little knees,

5
00:00:18,366 --> 00:00:21,966
Blow around like autumn leaves in the breeze!

6
00:00:22,366 --> 00:00:25,866
Jump up high, touch the ceiling and the floor,

7
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:29,600
Run in place, run a little bit more!

8
00:00:29,866 --> 00:00:33,300
Now listen closely, stop in your track...

9
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:36,966
Three, two, one... FREEZE like a statue back!

10
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:40,066
Sudden silence for 2 beats

11
00:00:42,766 --> 00:00:46,400
Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle, dance all around!

12
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:50,266
Stomp your feet upon the ground!

13
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:53,800
Wiggle to the left, wiggle to the right,

14
00:00:53,966 --> 00:00:56,400
Dancing with all your might!

15
00:00:59,566 --> 00:01:03,266
Spin like a top, spinning round and round,

16
00:01:03,466 --> 00:01:07,000
Tiptoe softly without making a sound!

17
00:01:07,066 --> 00:01:10,866
Flap your arms like an eagle in the sky,

18
00:01:10,966 --> 00:01:14,266
Wave both hands up way up high!

19
00:01:14,866 --> 00:01:18,266
Get ready, get steady, hold your pose...

20
00:01:18,366 --> 00:01:22,133
Three, two, one... FREEZE and touch your nose!

21
00:01:22,133 --> 00:01:25,066
Sudden silence for 2 beats

22
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:31,366
Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle, dance all around!

23
00:01:31,366 --> 00:01:35,200
Stomp your feet upon the ground!

24
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,766
Wiggle to the left, wiggle to the right,

25
00:01:38,966 --> 00:01:41,333
Dancing with all your might!

26
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:47,533
You didn't move! You win!

27
00:01:47,966 --> 00:01:51,066
Everybody sit down and breathe

